== 👤 Executive Profile & Background ==
'''Gautam Kumar Maurya''' (commonly known in engineering tracks as <b>GKM</b> / '''[[User:Gkm563|gkm563]]''') is a Bachelor of Technology student specializing in '''Computer Science & Engineering (Data Science)''' at the '''[https://www.united.ac.in/ United Institute of Technology], Prayagraj''', India.<ref name="portfolio">[https://gkm563.github.io/ Gautam Kumar Maurya - Official Engineering Portfolio]</ref> He is an **AKTU CSE (Data Science) Branch Topper (1st Rank)** and Top 5 college-wide rank holder at UIT Prayagraj.<ref name="aktu_rank">[https://gkm563.github.io/#achievements Academic Ranks & Awards - Gautam Kumar Maurya]</ref>

He operates actively within global open-source ecosystems, engineering structural solutions, data pipelines, and core platform enhancements. His active workflows span engineering nodes like Gerrit, Phabricator, GitHub, GitLab, and Translatewiki.net.<ref name="gerrit_profile">[https://gerrit.wikimedia.org/r/q/owner:gkmwin563%2540gmail.com Wikimedia Gerrit Code Review - Gkm563 Profile & Patchsets]</ref>

